    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/1abe5b4d8d7995482358f41225202aad.poster.avif?t=1747035877\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/1abe5b4d8d7995482358f41225202aad.webm?t=1747035877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/1abe5b4d8d7995482358f41225202aad.mp4?t=1747035877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lighthouse is a horror adventure game blending exploration and puzzles, set in a shadowy world where childhood innocence clashes with the madness of fanatical adults.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a child who awakens in an isolated monastery after undergoing terrible experiments. A mysterious parasite lodged in his arm now emits a strange light \u2014 the only glimmer of hope in a place consumed by darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid monsters, solve puzzles, and use your parasite to survive and move through oppressive and contemplative environments to uncover the monastery's secrets and find your way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A child, a parasite, a dangerous world</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/9dffc5fd18188e257939fb000fa24893.poster.avif?t=1747035877\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/9dffc5fd18188e257939fb000fa24893.webm?t=1747035877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/9dffc5fd18188e257939fb000fa24893.mp4?t=1747035877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the light of your parasite to survive in this hostile world and uncover the secrets buried in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your light will be your greatest ally in exploring the monastery. But beware: something always lurks in the darkness\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Light-based puzzles</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/701ebd38b42e2aefebb5f76ddd2c60e6.poster.avif?t=1747035877\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/701ebd38b42e2aefebb5f76ddd2c60e6.webm?t=1747035877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/701ebd38b42e2aefebb5f76ddd2c60e6.mp4?t=1747035877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve light-based puzzles to progress and unlock new areas. As your journey unfolds, your parasite will mutate.\u00a0This will change the way you interact with the world and its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run in the dark or walk in the light</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/4f8981fd89e23a63b28aeb1555e9a34c.poster.avif?t=1747035877\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/4f8981fd89e23a63b28aeb1555e9a34c.webm?t=1747035877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/4f8981fd89e23a63b28aeb1555e9a34c.mp4?t=1747035877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, survival comes down to a choice: run blindly through the dark, or move slowly and watch the danger approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anticipate, react... or fall. Your instincts will be your only advantage in the most intense moments of the monastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/59d474bd4b908daa6ab1e67fee57acd1.poster.avif?t=1747035877\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/59d474bd4b908daa6ab1e67fee57acd1.webp?t=1747035877\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=231 /></picture></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/1abe5b4d8d7995482358f41225202aad.poster.avif?t=1747035877\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/1abe5b4d8d7995482358f41225202aad.webm?t=1747035877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/1abe5b4d8d7995482358f41225202aad.mp4?t=1747035877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lighthouse is a horror adventure game blending exploration and puzzles, set in a shadowy world where childhood innocence clashes with the madness of fanatical adults.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a child who awakens in an isolated monastery after undergoing terrible experiments. A mysterious parasite lodged in his arm now emits a strange light \u2014 the only glimmer of hope in a place consumed by darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid monsters, solve puzzles, and use your parasite to survive and move through oppressive and contemplative environments to uncover the monastery's secrets and find your way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A child, a parasite, a dangerous world</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/9dffc5fd18188e257939fb000fa24893.poster.avif?t=1747035877\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/9dffc5fd18188e257939fb000fa24893.webm?t=1747035877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/9dffc5fd18188e257939fb000fa24893.mp4?t=1747035877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the light of your parasite to survive in this hostile world and uncover the secrets buried in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your light will be your greatest ally in exploring the monastery. But beware: something always lurks in the darkness\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Light-based puzzles</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/701ebd38b42e2aefebb5f76ddd2c60e6.poster.avif?t=1747035877\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/701ebd38b42e2aefebb5f76ddd2c60e6.webm?t=1747035877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/701ebd38b42e2aefebb5f76ddd2c60e6.mp4?t=1747035877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve light-based puzzles to progress and unlock new areas. As your journey unfolds, your parasite will mutate.\u00a0This will change the way you interact with the world and its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run in the dark or walk in the light</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/4f8981fd89e23a63b28aeb1555e9a34c.poster.avif?t=1747035877\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/4f8981fd89e23a63b28aeb1555e9a34c.webm?t=1747035877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/4f8981fd89e23a63b28aeb1555e9a34c.mp4?t=1747035877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, survival comes down to a choice: run blindly through the dark, or move slowly and watch the danger approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anticipate, react... or fall. Your instincts will be your only advantage in the most intense moments of the monastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/59d474bd4b908daa6ab1e67fee57acd1.poster.avif?t=1747035877\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600850/extras/59d474bd4b908daa6ab1e67fee57acd1.webp?t=1747035877\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=231 /></picture></span></p>",
